yserver (1.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.6.0.
    - XDMCP, TCP transport and server reset for shared desktops, both
      off by default at build time.
    - Resize/damage, border and Composite correctness fixes.
    - GLX visual fixes for QtWebEngine and glmark2.
    - RANDR CRTC mode hotplug relight.

 -- Jos Dehaes <jos.dehaes@gmail.com>  Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200

