yserver (1.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release 1.5.0.
    - X11 server-side window borders.
    - Damage-clipped repaint for non-composited desktops.
    - Direct compositor scanout.
    - DRI3 1.4 syncobjs served through DRM.

